ModeChangedFlag equ 1ToRect         equ ModeChangedFlag+2FromRect       equ ToRect+8SavePortHandle equ FromRect+8PicSize        equ SavePortHandle+4PlayIndex      equ PicSize+4PicToDrawPtr   equ PlayIndex+4TempDataPtr    equ PicToDrawPtr+4TempCount      equ TempDataPtr+4       ; should this be word or long?OpCodeToDo     equ TempCount+4TheRect        equ OpCodeToDo+2         ; all these will be initialized toOvalSize       equ TheRect+8            ; zeroPenLoc         equ OvalSize+8TextLoc        equ PenLoc+4CurPortRef     equ TextLoc+4TheClip        equ CurPortRef+4UserClip       equ TheClip+4ThisFontID     equ UserClip+4ThisTextFace   equ ThisFontID+4ThisTextSize   equ ThisTextFace+2ThisVersion    equ ThisTextSize+2QuickDrawD     equ ThisVersion+2CallersD       equ QuickDrawD+2CallersRTL1    equ CallersD+2CallersRTL2    equ CallersRTL1+3ToRectPtr      equ CallersRTL2+3PicToDrawH     equ ToRectPtr+4